---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[])"
---
Live Linux USB port monitor: which socket, what link speed, USB-C / PD power

Usage: plugii [OPTIONS]
       plugii <COMMAND>

Commands:
  watch    Live view: updates as devices, chargers and displays come and go
  capture  Copy the sysfs files plugii reads into DIR, as a test fixture
  replay   Play back a file written by `watch --record`
  labels   List the labels file's sockets, peers, USB-C ports and devices
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -H, --health    Health verdict only
      --json      Print the snapshot as JSON
      --firmware  Also check firmware versions (DMI, fwupd, vendor catalogs; uses the network)
      --refresh   With --firmware: fetch the vendor catalog even if a cached copy is fresh
  -w, --watch     Same as `plugii watch`
  -h, --help      Print help
  -V, --version   Print version
